        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) Eligible, occupational employees, including former employees, not test qualified for positions being sought via the LTP will be provided the opportunity to take such test(s) in the same order of consideration applicable to filling job vacancies subject to the availability of testing resources and the job vacancy activity rate for the position(s) being sought. Within each step of the order of consideration if there are more requests for a specific test than can be accommodated on the test schedule, employees requesting the test will be scheduled in seniority order, most senior first.",
